# 只构建已锁定的 Vite 应用。静态网页构建上下文严禁向 Docker 守护进程发送本机
# node_modules、旧 dist 输出、抓包或研究证据。
# English: Only build locked Vite apps. Static web page construction context is strictly prohibited from sending
# native node_modules, old dist output, packet captures or research evidence.
